{"id":2168260,"shortDescription":"Estás perdido en el Vacío de las Bermudas, donde el océano es infinito y la tierra firme es preciada. Construye tu barco en una botella y sobrevive en alta mar. Navega hacia nuevas tierras, construye campamentos, caza tesoros, comercia... ¡y defiende tu barco de los piratas!","developers":["Pangea Game Studios"],"publishers":["indie.io"],"categories":["Un jugador","Multijugador","Cooperativo","Cooperativo en línea","Compat. parcial con mando","Préstamo familiar"],"releaseDateRaw":"11 OCT 2025","background":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2168260/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1795225917","screenshots":[{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2168260/fa54cb3821bc2541315b8f62c61a61fe32b144f7/ss_fa54cb3821bc2541315b8f62c61a61fe32b144f7.600x338.jpg?t=1795225917","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2168260/fa54cb3821bc2541315b8f62c61a61fe32b144f7/ss_fa54cb3821bc2541315b8f62c61a61fe32b144f7.1920x1080.jpg?t=1795225917"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2168260/b7b4c232146c9820d1134a84faa60b5041df5064/ss_b7b4c232146c9820d1134a84faa60b5041df5064.600x338.jpg?t=1795225917","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2168260/b7b4c232146c9820d1134a84faa60b5041df5064/ss_b7b4c232146c9820d1134a84faa60b5041df5064.1920x1080.jpg?t=1795225917"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2168260/4a42ff03ea0e05dffd13b9e486587ac143a5afda/ss_4a42ff03ea0e05dffd13b9e486587ac143a5afda.600x338.jpg?t=1795225917","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2168260/4a42ff03ea0e05dffd13b9e486587ac143a5afda/ss_4a42ff03ea0e05dffd13b9e486587ac143a5afda.1920x1080.jpg?t=1795225917"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2168260/08eeb194eec9c1601cadb519326f176078f4fd08/ss_08eeb194eec9c1601cadb5193